Time variable: t, 1 to 24
        Delta: 1 unit

. gen y = 0.7 * (t - 12)^2 / 50 + 2

. replace y = . in 9
(1 real change made, 1 to missing)

. gen y_lead2 = F2.y
(3 missing values generated)

